{"id": "byd-2026-10-10-008", "date": "2026-10-10", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q4", "month": 10, "week": 41, "weekday": "Sat"}, "entities": {"companies": ["byd"], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["industry_general"], "sentiment": {"label": "neutral", "score": 0.0, "keywords": []}, "importance": {"score": 0.5, "reasons": []}, "title": "BYD builds 150,000th commercial NEV – an 800 hp Q3 electric semi truck", "content": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://electrek.co/wp-content/uploads/sites/3/2026/10/byd-battery-truck.jpg?quality=82&#038;strip=all&#038;w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">The BYD Q3 battery-electric semi truck shown here marked a major production milestone this week, becoming the 150,000th new energy commercial vehicle to roll off the assembly line at BYD’s truck plant in Huai’an, Jiangsu province.</p>\n\n\n\n <a data-layer-pagetype=\"post\" data-layer-postcategory=\"byd,commercial-evs", "sources": [{"name": "electrek", "url": "https://electrek.co/2026/10/10/byd-builds-150000th-commercial-nev-an-800-hp-q3-electric-semi-truck/", "type": "rss"}]}
{"id": "nio-2026-10-10-009", "date": "2026-10-10", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q4", "month": 10, "week": 41, "weekday": "Sat"}, "entities": {"companies": ["nio"], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["industry_general"], "sentiment": {"label": "positive", "score": 1.0, "keywords": ["record"]}, "importance": {"score": 0.65, "reasons": ["情緒極端"]}, "title": "Battery swap works: Nio completes 1.2 million swaps in a SINGLE WEEK", "content": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://electrek.co/wp-content/uploads/sites/3/2026/10/nio-record.jpg?quality=82&#038;strip=all&#038;w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">While oil prices and range anxiety dominate Western EV headlines, Nio’s battery-swap system in China keeps reaching new milestones that prove the technology can rival a traditional refueling infrastructure at scale, performing 1.2 million battery swaps over the holiday.</p>\n\n\n\n <a data-layer-pagetype=\"post\" data-layer", "sources": [{"name": "electrek", "url": "https://electrek.co/2026/10/10/battery-swap-works-nio-completes-1-2-million-swaps-in-a-single-week/", "type": "rss"}]}
