{"id": "byd-2026-10-10-011", "date": "2026-10-10", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q4", "month": 10, "week": 41, "weekday": "Sat"}, "entities": {"companies": ["byd"], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["industry_general"], "sentiment": {"label": "neutral", "score": 0.0, "keywords": []}, "importance": {"score": 0.5, "reasons": []}, "title": "Geely Galaxy launches Cruiser 700 to take on BYD, GWM in off-road SUV market", "content": "<p><img src=\"https://cnevpost.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/2026101013574775.jpg\" alt=\"\" style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto;\" /></p><p>The limited-time price of the Cruiser 700, including a trade-in subsidy, is 169,800 yuan ($25,220), and firm orders exceeded 10,000 units within the first 12 minutes.</p>\n<p>For details, please visit <a href=\"https://cnevpost.com\">CnEVPost</a> (cnev.co).</p>\n", "sources": [{"name": "cnevpost", "url": "https://cnevpost.com/2026/10/10/geely-galaxy-launches-cruiser-700-suv/", "type": "rss"}]}
